### Create Ticket
POST http://localhost:5181/api/v1/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "API smoke test",
    "description": "Created via http file",
    "priority": "High",
    "dueAt": null
}

### Get unknown ticket -> should be 404
GET http://localhost:5181/api/v1/tickets/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Search invalid paging -> should be 400
GET http://localhost:5181/api/v1/tickets?page=0&pageSize=25

### Assistant chat -> streams SSE, model may create a ticket via tool call
POST http://localhost:5300/api/v1/assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream
X-Api-Key: dev-api-key-not-a-secret

{
    "messages": [
        { "role": "User", "content": "Der Drucker im 3. Stock reagiert seit heute Morgen nicht mehr, mehrere Kollegen sind betroffen. Bitte bis Freitag 9 Uhr beheben." }
    ]
}
